# Quote & contact enquiry delivery — see docs/quote-delivery.md
#
# Configure AT LEAST ONE of the three options below. With none set, submitted
# enquiries are only written to the server log and the customer is asked to
# send the details themselves by WhatsApp or email.
#
# All of these are SERVER-side variables. Do not prefix any of them with VITE_,
# which would bundle the value into client-side JavaScript.

# --- Option 1: email (simplest) ---------------------------------------------
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxx
# QUOTE_EMAIL_TO=info@housemovingexperts.com
# QUOTE_EMAIL_FROM=Website <quotes@housemovingexperts.com>

# --- Option 2: webhook (Zapier / Make / n8n / CRM) ---------------------------
# QUOTE_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/000000/abcdef

# --- Option 3: database (durable storage) ------------------------------------
# SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxxxxx.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGci...
# QUOTE_TABLE=quote_requests
